          <p class="text-gray-300 leading-relaxed mb-4">
            The best infrared heater is the one that puts warmth where you sit and has the safety features to run without worry: tip-over and overheat shut-off, a certification mark on the label and enclosed elements if you have children or pets. For most rooms that is the Dr. Infrared DR-978; for a tighter budget, the Comfort Zone CZ2062C; for a single desk, the BLACK+DECKER BHTI06.
          </p>
